      "id": 1000964,
      "name": "[Affinity] Overlord's Accompaniment",
      "desc": "Caesar has evoked the Mindscape: <color=#FFAF2C>[Spearhead Advance]</color>.\nSpearhead Advance: When Caesar becomes the active character in combat, she instantly buffs all squad members with a <color=#FFFFFF>Radiant Aegis</color> shield. This effect can trigger once every 300s. While <color=#FFFFFF>Radiant Aegis</color> is active, enemies within a 5m radius of the shield bearer suffer a 15% All-Attribute RES reduction.",
      "desc2": "For Caesar, obstacles on the path are irrelevant. As long as she can roll over them, they're not obstacles anymore.",
